This block sets `draft  yes`.

The file is on disk and in the repo. The site 404s it, and it is absent from
the index, the tag pages, the contradictions, and every backlink list — as if
it did not exist. Nothing links here because nothing *can* link here.

Set `hidden  yes` instead when you want the softer version: reachable by
anyone with the URL, but never listed anywhere.
